{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:43 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:43 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:43 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"姚本輝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/9f8b5454a0acb6a6a9a1ac8cabc8da5c/2026-10/7edf0081-4df4-4c1e-bbc4-25379a04cf3a.jpg\"/><p>香港兩位女見習騎師黃寶妮和袁幸堯很勤力，每朝都一早到場操馬，其中袁幸堯今早為「包裝明將」主操時，姚本輝專心地觀看該駒操練情況。</p><img alt=\"袁幸堯「包裝明將」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f396c1fb7d5e21c05adffb3cd50528fb/2026-10/351b8f19-616b-41f1-8bcd-7f7b9e5267c4.jpg\" title=\"袁幸堯「包裝明將」\"/><p>袁幸堯「包裝明將」</p><p>姚本輝今早到場觀看多匹有程馬操練，除了「包裝明將」外，還有「魅影諜飛」、「全神貫注」、「愛心萬里」、「勁大威猛」及「利高八斗」。當以上各駒出大圈操練時，姚本輝緊張地高舉望遠鏡吼實。</p><img alt=\"巫顯東「愛心萬里」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3811b8b9015830fc4e1175312c70096a/2026-10/560a3d12-b76f-4c06-87c0-32af5b5d9180_0.jpg\" title=\"巫顯東「愛心萬里」\"/><p>巫顯東「愛心萬里」</p><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:03:50.459473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:43:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:16.690586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:17.202578+00:00","content_hash":"630dd40c08ea21bcf49132a9b6895418bc4cd0e0fff31bf60edd7edfa2940e82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}